title: Sophos Firewall: System services
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Status of the 21 SFOS system services (sfosXGServiceStatus) in one service.
 Every service that was running at discovery has to stay running; otherwise
 the service goes {CRIT} (configurable). Services that were not running at
 discovery are only listed. Single services can be ignored via the rule
 "Sophos Firewall services".

 Rediscover the service after enabling or disabling features on the firewall.

discovery:
 One service is created; the list of running services is stored with it.
